{"name":"Playing Hooky","hex":"#8b8c6b","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"playing hooky","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Verb","definitions":["present participle and gerund of play hooky"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/playing_hooky"}],"entries":[{"title":"Truancy","blocks":[{"text":"Truancy is any intentional, unauthorised, and/or legally debatable absence from compulsory education. It is a deliberate absence by a student's own free will and usually does not refer to legitimate excused absences, such as ones related to medical conditions. Truancy is usually explicitly defined in the school's handbook of policies and procedures. Attending school but not going to class is called internal truancy. Some children whose parents claim to homeschool have also been found truant in the United States."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Truancy","wikidata":"Q1545700"},{"title":"Hooky (webcomic)","blocks":[{"text":"Hooky is a fantasy adventure webcomic written and illustrated by Spanish author Míriam Bonastre Tur. Originally serialized as a webtoon on Naver Corporation's Webtoon app from 2015 to 2020, Hooky was eventually released in print by Houghton Mifflin Harcourt in 2021."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/4/4c/Hooky_cover_illustration.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hooky_(webcomic)","wikidata":"Q109951523"},{"title":"Play (activity)","blocks":[{"text":"Play is a range of intrinsically motivated activities done for recreation. Play is commonly associated with children and juvenile-level activities, but may be engaged in at any life stage, and among other higher-functioning animals as well, most notably mammals and birds."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Playfulness_by_Paul_Manship%2C_1912-1914_-_DSC03107.JPG/330px-Playfulness_by_Paul_Manship%2C_1912-1914_-_DSC03107.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.o